sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports security profile 1 and/or 2
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: The CSMS must have a password configured<br>that equals the configured BasicAuthPassword at the Test System
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: HTTP upgrade request with Authorization header (username/password combination)
    Note right of CS: AUTHORIZATION: Basic Base64 encoded(Configured ChargingStationId:Configured BasicAuthPassword)

    CSMS->>CSMS: Validate username/password combination
    CSMS-->>CS: Upgrade connection to a (secured) WebSocket connection

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: Notify the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    CSMS-->>CS: CSMS responds accordingly
